# МОДУЛЬ 3: ТОПОЛОГИЧЕСКАЯ ПАМЯТЬ И ФАЗОВЫЙ ГИСТЕРЕЗИС
# ============================================================================
class PhaseHysteresisMemory:
    def __init__(self, window_size: int = 4):
        self.history = deque([0] * window_size, maxlen=window_size)
        self.running_sum = 0

    def register_state(self, state: int) -> int:
        self.running_sum -= self.history[0]
        self.history.append(state)
        self.running_sum += state
        
        avg = self.running_sum / len(self.history)
        if avg > 0.33: return 1
        elif avg >= -0.33: return 0
        else: return -1


